  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Java package names in 3.4 have been changed, so legacy LLStore plug-ins will no longer work.  Provide some kind of adapter to allow these to work.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Pasted from FCREPO-622:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2) Legacy LLStore plugins will need to be updated. Preferably to plug in via Akubra, but if that can't be done, we should try to provide a solution that allows the use of these older plugins (like a legacy llstore jar, and an akubra adapter) ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
