  "description": "<p>Java package names in 3.4 have been changed, so legacy LLStore plug-ins will no longer work.  Provide some kind of adapter to allow these to work.</p>\n\n<p>Pasted from FCREPO-622:</p>\n\n<p>2) Legacy LLStore plugins will need to be updated. Preferably to plug in via Akubra, but if that can't be done, we should try to provide a solution that allows the use of these older plugins (like a legacy llstore jar, and an akubra adapter) </p>",
